  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "スターの　かたちを　した　アメざいく。\nマホミルに　もたせてあげると\nくるくる　まわって　よろこぶ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "별 모양의 사탕공예.\n마빌크에게 지니게 하면\n빙빙 돌며 기뻐한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "星星形狀的工藝糖果。\n讓小仙奶攜帶的話，\n牠會高興得轉圈圈。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un bonbon en forme d’étoile.\nQuand on le donne à un Crèmy, il danse de bonheur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Zuckerwerk in Form eines Sterns. Gibt man es Hokumil\nzum Tragen, dreht es sich vor Freude im Kreis.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Figura de caramelo con forma de estrella. Al dárselo a\nMilcery, se pone a girar rebosante de alegría.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonbon a forma di stella. Se dato a Milcery,\nil Pokémon farà le piroette per la felicità.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A star-shaped sweet. When a Milcery\nholds this, it spins around happily.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "スターの　形を　した　アメ細工。\nマホミルに　持たせてあげると\nくるくる　回って　喜ぶ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "星星形状的工艺糖果。\n让小仙奶携带的话，\n会高兴地转圈圈。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
